---
import { links } from '../data/links';
---

<section class="container-page flex flex-col gap-8 pt-[120px] pb-20 max-md:pt-20 max-md:pb-16">
  <span class="caption text-ink-2"
    >A design systems studio · for legacy products and teams scaling with agents</span
  >
  <h1 class="m-0 max-w-[11ch] text-h1">Design systems people and agents read the same way.</h1>
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-x-16 gap-y-7">
    <p class="m-0 max-w-[52ch] text-body-lg text-pretty text-ink-2">
      We turn years of drifted UI into one system: tokens, components and documentation that a
      designer, an engineer and a coding agent understand the same way. Product design when you need
      the screens too.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5">
      <a href="#audit" class="pill pill-ink pill-lg">Get a free audit</a>
      <a href={links.bookCall} class="pill pill-outline pill-lg">Book a call</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="m-0 font-mono text-code leading-normal text-ink-2">
    We audit before we quote. The first look at your system is free and read-only.
  </p>
</section>
